{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/15025","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/15025/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/15025/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/15025/events","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/15025","id":1450319681,"node_id":"I_kwDOBlCVUc5Wch9B","number":15025,"title":"[DocDB] YCQL: Slow DELETE execution for a deleted row","user":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":711841622,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MTE4NDE2MjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":"This issue is a bug"},{"id":1290759928,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjkwNzU5OTI4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/area/docdb","name":"area/docdb","color":"0c4fcc","default":false,"description":"YugabyteDB core features"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"},{"id":2156857038,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTU2ODU3MDM4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/area/ycql","name":"area/ycql","color":"0c4fcc","default":false,"description":"Yugabyte CQL (YCQL)"},{"id":4199362411,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBlCVUc76TS9r","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/2.14%20Backport%20Required","name":"2.14 Backport Required","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":""},{"id":4721920290,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBlCVUc8AAAABGXLJIg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/2.16%20Backport%20Required","name":"2.16 Backport Required","color":"24F4C7","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-15T20:10:24Z","updated_at":"2022-11-25T09:03:00Z","closed_at":"2022-11-25T09:03:00Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-4260](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-4260)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nIf we execute YCQL DELETE statement twice - the Index can be unexpectedly updated.\r\nThe wrong entry in the Index tablet has NULL PK.\r\nThese extra entries get written with the same null values of hash and range keys regardless of the primary key. So, there could be conflicts on these index keys between many otherwise unrelated deletion operations. In that case, we would wait for `SharedLockManager` locks a lot and only one such write would get replicated at a time.\r\nAs result the second DELETE operation can be very slow in case of many parallel DELETE operations.\r\n\r\nReproducer:\r\n```\r\nCREATE TABLE users (id text PRIMARY KEY, name text, age int)\r\n       WITH tablets = 1  AND transactions = {'enabled': 'true'};\r\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS name_idx ON users(name) WITH tablets=1;\r\n\r\nINSERT INTO users(id, name, age) VALUES('id1', 'name1', 25);\r\nDELETE FROM users WHERE id='id1';\r\nDELETE FROM users WHERE id='id1';\r\n```\r\n\r\nLog:\r\n```\r\n=== INSERT INTO users(id, name, age) VALUES('id1', 'name1', 25); ===\r\nDoSetPrimitive: doc_path=DocPath(DocKey(0xf143, [\"id1\"], []), [SystemColumnId(0)]), value={ value_pb: 0x00007fbe81470228 ->  value_type: kNullLow }\r\nDoSetPrimitive: doc_path=DocPath(DocKey(0xf143, [\"id1\"], []), [ColumnId(11)]), value={ value_pb: 0x000055cf663ede90 -> string_value: \"name1\" value_type: kInvalid }\r\nDoSetPrimitive: doc_path=DocPath(DocKey(0xf143, [\"id1\"], []), [ColumnId(12)]), value={ value_pb: 0x000055cf663edef0 -> int32_value: 25 value_type: kInvalid }\r\nUpdating indexes\r\nDoSetPrimitive: doc_path=DocPath(DocKey(0x4d7d, [\"name1\"], [\"id1\"]), [SystemColumnId(0)]), value={ value_pb: 0x00007fbe81470228 ->  value_type: kNullLow }\r\n\r\n=== FIST: delete from users where id='id1'; ===\r\nDoSetPrimitive: doc_path=DocPath(DocKey(0xf143, [\"id1\"], []), []), value={ value_pb: 0x00007fbe81470228 ->  value_type: kTombstone }\r\nUpdating indexes\r\nDoSetPrimitive: doc_path=DocPath(DocKey(0x4d7d, [\"name1\"], [\"id1\"]), []), value={ value_pb: 0x00007fbe81470228 ->  value_type: kTombstone }\r\n\r\n=== SECOND: delete from users where id='id1'; ===\r\nDoSetPrimitive: doc_path=DocPath(DocKey(0xf143, [\"id1\"], []), []), value={ value_pb: 0x00007fbe81470228 ->  value_type: kTombstone }\r\nUpdating indexes\r\nDoSetPrimitive: doc_path=DocPath(DocKey(0x4d44, [null], [null]), []), value={ value_pb: 0x00007fbe81470228 ->  value_type: kTombstone }\r\n```\r\nThe `DocKey(0x4d44, [null], [null])` is the wrong entry.\r\nAfter fixing we should not touch the Index during the second DELETE processing.\r\n(Actually the table update is also useless, as the row is already deleted.)","closed_by":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/15025/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/15025/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}